Third-party code
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Two files contain code copied from other projects. That code keeps its
original license, and its notice is reproduced at the top of each file.

  ModelComparison/pipeline_dynotears.py
      DYNOTEARS optimizer from causalnex (causalnex/structure/dynotears.py).
      Copyright QuantumBlack Visual Analytics Limited.
      Apache License, Version 2.0: http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

  ModelComparison/pipeline_cuts_plus.py
      CUTS+ network and training loop from https://github.com/jarrycyx/UNN
      (folder CUTS_Plus). Copyright (c) jarrycyx / UNN contributors.
      MIT License.
